      "content": "It's understandable that the idea of \"just being\" feels overwhelming when you've been driven by intense purpose for so long. When the external goals are met, the internal scaffolding that supported your daily life can crumble, leaving a void. Perhaps the book isn't finished; maybe the next chapter is about writing something entirely different, something that doesn't require a grand peak.",
